## Scenarios

### file tool

#### extension detection

#### identifies .spl as Simple source

- Verify: identifies .spl as Simple source
   - Expected: is_spl is true


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: identifies .spl as Simple source")
val name = "main.spl"
val is_spl = name.ends_with(".spl")
expect(is_spl).to_equal(true)
```

</details>

